The old gate passed with zero work. The gate now also requires a NEW file
experiments/sc-e1/tests/test_od4_pool_scaling.py containing real assertions
proving: (a) pool-scaled gaming costs are implemented in the sim, (b) the
wash-trader archetype's profit is strictly LOWER with OD-4 active than in the
baseline run. Empty or assertion-free tests violate the standing rule.
